{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17161","headline":"奉和圣制重阳日即事六韵 · 权德舆","name":"奉和圣制重阳日即事六韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嘉节在阳数，至欢朝野同。\n恩随千锺洽，庆属五稼丰。\n时菊洗露华，秋池涵霁空。\n金丝响仙乐，劒舃罗宗公。\n天道光下济，睿词敷大中。\n多慙撃壤曲，何以荅尧聪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17161.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17161","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}